(7521545, 1201859, 98565, '<td valign="top">Ich muss Georges ein bisschen recht geben - der Hintergrund ist wahnsinnig unruhig vor allem das pinkfarbene Kleid unter ihre Achsel stört mich persönlich extrem. Ohne Leute wär''s natürlich fad. Noch mehr Unschärfe im HG hätte geholfen, aber dazu war vermutlich zu viel Licht.<br/>Was mir sehr gefällt ist die "Einsamkeit" der Violinspielerin - alle hasten vorbei und beachtet sie</td>', 'Ich muss Georges ein bisschen recht geben - der Hintergrund ist wahnsinnig unruhig vor allem das pinkfarbene Kleid unter ihre Achsel stört mich persönlich extrem. Ohne Leute wär''s natürlich fad. Noch mehr Unschärfe im HG hätte geholfen, aber dazu war vermutlich zu viel Licht.Was mir sehr gefällt ist die "Einsamkeit" der Violinspielerin - alle hasten vorbei und beachtet sie', '2017-07-05 04:34:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7521546, 1201653, 20056, '<td valign="top">Thanks all for your comments... I am glad You found it interesting.<br/>Yes, it is a picture with heavy photoshoping: That was THE condition from the model :)<br/>feel free to visit her painting hut: <a href="https://sgonzalezfineart.wordpress.com/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">https://sgonzalezfineart.wordpress.com/</a> <br/></td>', 'Thanks all for your comments... I am glad You found it interesting.Yes, it is a picture with heavy photoshoping: That was THE condition from the model :)feel free to visit her painting hut: https://sgonzalezfineart.wordpress.com/ ', '2017-07-05 04:39:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7521547, 1201759, 98565, '<td valign="top">Lost places and pretty girls are always a good combination! <br/>I like this picture a lot although I have to agree with Georges about the sharpness on hair and boots: that puts even more emphasis on her butt which isn''t necessary at all. The light is perfect imho. <br/>I haven''t read or seen Game of  Thrones so I''m not familiar with the story of the shy maid. To me this looks anything but shy...<br/>When I saw this picture at voting I was wondering who dared to show this much bare skin. I''m not surprised that it didn''t end up higher because of voters who have a problem with nuditiy. For me it deserves a ribbon.</td>', 'Lost places and pretty girls are always a good combination! I like this picture a lot although I have to agree with Georges about the sharpness on hair and boots: that puts even more emphasis on her butt which isn''t necessary at all. The light is perfect imho. I haven''t read or seen Game of  Thrones so I''m not familiar with the story of the shy maid. To me this looks anything but shy...When I saw this picture at voting I was wondering who dared to show this much bare skin. I''m not surprised that it didn''t end up higher because of voters who have a problem with nuditiy. For me it deserves a ribbon.', '2017-07-05 04:50:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(7521549, 1201691, 181331, '<td valign="top">Awesome work... is this a HDR?</td>', 'Awesome work... is this a HDR?', '2017-07-05 05:16:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7521550, 1201759, 137576, '<td valign="top">I but a radial blur around her bum to emphasis it, I must have forgot the dpc rush to find flaw and not see it as a feature! And on my screen which is a calibrated imac27" the back wall is exposed as I wanted can see all the detail and isn''t to dark at all, I checked on mac book pro retina and iPhone maybe George your monitor is set to dark I''d be intrigued to see a photo of how you see it? <br/> <br/>The shy maid is a boat in game of thrones books and was just on the audio book as I submitted and I liked the juxtaposition of the title as clearly a girl in a spanking skirt isn''t shy! This seemed to be lost a few ppl!!<br/> <br/>I know the soccer mum conservativeness of dpc meant it''d score low but dpc used to have content like this in the hat days so I''m Pushing against imposed boundaries ppl should vote on the photographic merit and how it fits the challenge not on their own predisposition to the subject matter<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-07-05 04:44:36.</i></td>', 'I but a radial blur around her bum to emphasis it, I must have forgot the dpc rush to find flaw and not see it as a feature! And on my screen which is a calibrated imac27" the back wall is exposed as I wanted can see all the detail and isn''t to dark at all, I checked on mac book pro retina and iPhone maybe George your monitor is set to dark I''d be intrigued to see a photo of how you see it?  The shy maid is a boat in game of thrones books and was just on the audio book as I submitted and I liked the juxtaposition of the title as clearly a girl in a spanking skirt isn''t shy! This seemed to be lost a few ppl!! I know the soccer mum conservativeness of dpc meant it''d score low but dpc used to have content like this in the hat days so I''m Pushing against imposed boundaries ppl should vote on the photographic merit and how it fits the challenge not on their own predisposition to the subject matter', '2017-07-05 05:38:20.000000', '2017-07-05 05:44:36.000000', 0),
(7521551, 1201759, 137576, '<td valign="top">Only 4 x 1''s and 2s I''m disappointed people<br/> <br/>Views vs votes is funny<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-07-05 04:42:53.</i></td>', 'Only 4 x 1''s and 2s I''m disappointed people Views vs votes is funny', '2017-07-05 05:42:21.000000', '2017-07-05 05:42:53.000000', 0),
(7521552, 1201699, 98565, '<td valign="top">This was my only 10 - crop and vignette are stunning!<br/>It makes me wonder if that gentle giant was standing there waiting for something, if he/she was walking away or munching some grass...and I like the vastness of the surrounding  <br/> <br/>Maybe I like your picture that much because it remembers me of one my own pics, here is a link if you are interested:<br/><a href="//www.fotocommunity.de/photo/zartbesaitet-barbara-neider/20018361" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">gentle soul</a> <br/>It is accompanied with a childrens poem, this is a rough translation (at least I tried):<br/> <br/> <br/>Highly sensitive<br/> <br/>The elephant is big and tall<br/>But gentle is his nature<br/>His heart is made of creamy quark<br/>His soul is tender like a violet<br/> <br/>Once this big, tall elephant<br/>It wasnt on purpose , I swear!<br/>Stepped on the circus directors hand<br/>They both wept bitter tears  <br/></td>', 'This was my only 10 - crop and vignette are stunning!It makes me wonder if that gentle giant was standing there waiting for something, if he/she was walking away or munching some grass...and I like the vastness of the surrounding   Maybe I like your picture that much because it remembers me of one my own pics, here is a link if you are interested:gentle soul It is accompanied with a childrens poem, this is a rough translation (at least I tried):  Highly sensitive The elephant is big and tallBut gentle is his natureHis heart is made of creamy quarkHis soul is tender like a violet Once this big, tall elephantIt wasnt on purpose , I swear!Stepped on the circus directors handThey both wept bitter tears  ', '2017-07-05 05:47:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7521556, 1201699, 100831, '<td valign="top">Fabulous.</td>', 'Fabulous.', '2017-07-05 05:54:28.000000', NULL, 0),
