(7521634, 1201820, 42256, '<td valign="top">He takes a picture, develops it inside the camera box to create the negative, hangs it to dry and then he takes another picture of the negative and develops it to create the positive. Those are negatives and positives hanging to dry. <br/> <br/>Here is a <a href="https://goo.gl/photos/fcGLcd594YyybWqe6" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">closeup of clipped pictures</a> <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LoVi:</b></div><hr/><i> appealing colors......     what''s clipped onto the easel line? </i></td></tr></table><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-07-05 22:43:38.</i></td>', 'He takes a picture, develops it inside the camera box to create the negative, hangs it to dry and then he takes another picture of the negative and develops it to create the positive. Those are negatives and positives hanging to dry.  Here is a closeup of clipped pictures  Originally posted by LoVi: appealing colors......     what''s clipped onto the easel line? ', '2017-07-05 18:16:02.000000', '2017-07-05 23:43:38.000000', 0),
(7521638, 1201392, 61396, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> great light and color. a beautiful shot that some people couldn''t recognize because they''re not used to color photos being beautiful in this way. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>so nice of you to notice. I think some people got blinded by the highlights, and couldn''t see past it to notice the man smile that I was imagining.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: great light and color. a beautiful shot that some people couldn''t recognize because they''re not used to color photos being beautiful in this way.  so nice of you to notice. I think some people got blinded by the highlights, and couldn''t see past it to notice the man smile that I was imagining.', '2017-07-05 18:47:05.000000', NULL, 0),
